# Cloudflare redirects for the static site. Astro copies public/ into
# dist/ byte for byte, and the Workers assets deploy reads this file from
# there (wrangler.toml).
#
# **The invite link** (docs/online-coop-prd.md §4.10). `join_url` writes
# `https://bongbong.io/j/CK7QX` onto the host's screen and into the
# lobby's QR, but the site is static and has no page at that path, so
# every scan and every shared link would 404. This sends it to the game
# with the code in the query, which `net::rooms::Invite::parse` reads off
# `window.bbInvite` exactly as it reads the path form - the two spellings
# are one rule in that file, and this is why both exist.
#
# The incoming query rides along: a QR minted against a local server
# carries `?rooms=ws://...` (`join_url` appends it for an overridden
# host), and it has to survive or the phone dials the deployed server
# instead of the laptop.
/j/*  /?join=:splat  302
